    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDUREACT, NO. 15 OF 1979",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      272.27,
      401.84,
      295.81
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      312.47,
      401.83,
      336.01
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Code of CriminalProcedure (Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      352.67,
      401.87,
      443.17
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 281 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act,No. 15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the substitution for thewords, \u201cappears to the court to be under the age of eighteenyears,\u201d of the words \u201cis under the age of eighteen years,at the time of the commission of such offence by suchperson,\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      459.83,
      401.86,
      510.13
    ],
    "text": "3. Section 286 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the substitution for the words and figures, \u201cInthis section and in section 288 the expression\u201d of the words\u201cIn this section the expression\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      526.91,
      401.87,
      550.33
    ],
    "text": "4. Section 288 of the principal enactment is herebyrepealed and the following section is substituted therefor:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      218.85,
      567.21,
      401.87,
      671.17
    ],
    "text": "288. When any person has been sentencedunder section 53 of the Penal Code(Chapter 19), such person shall be detained inan institution established under any writtenlaw for the detention of persons under the ageof eighteen years, for a period specified in thesentence and subject to the provisions of suchwritten law.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      566.22,
      209.13,
      622.22
    ],
    "text": "\u201cExecutionof sentencesunder section53 of thePenal Code(Chapter 19)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      527.82,
      452.85,
      574.22
    ],
    "text": "Replacementof section288 of theprincipalenactment",
